      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{依题意有} &amp; P(AB) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cup B) = p + q - r \\,, \\\\ \\text{于是} &amp; &amp; P(A \\overline{B}) = P(A - A \\overline{B}) = P(A) - P(AB) = p - (p + q - r) = r - q \\, ; \\\\ &amp; &amp; P(A \\overline{A \\cdot B}) = P(A \\overline{A \\cup B}) = 1 - P(A \\cup B) = 1 - r \\, ; \\\\ &amp; &amp; P(A \\overline{A \\cup B}) = P(A \\overline{A B}) = 1 - P(AB) = 1 - [P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cup B)] = 1 - p - q + r \\, ; \\\\ \\text{又} &amp; P(A \\overline{B}) = P(B - A \\overline{B}) = P(B) - P(AB) = q - (p + q - r) = r - p \\, , \\text{所以} &amp; \\\\ &amp; &amp; P(A \\cup \\overline{B}) = P(A \\overline{B}) = 1 - P(\\overline{A B}) = 1 - [P(B) - P(AB)] \\\\ &amp; &amp; \\qquad= 1 - [P(B) - P(A) - P(B) + P(A \\cup B)] = 1 + p - r \\, . \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{依题意有} &amp; P(AB) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cup B) = p + q - r \\,, \\\\ \\text{于是} &amp; &amp; P(A \\overline{B}) = P(A - A \\overline{B}) = P(A) - P(AB) = p - (p + q - r) = r - q \\, ; \\\\ &amp; &amp; P(A \\overline{A \\cdot B}) = P(A \\overline{A \\cup B}) = 1 - P(A \\cup B) = 1 - r \\, ; \\\\ &amp; &amp; P(A \\overline{A \\cup B}) = P(A \\overline{A B}) = 1 - P(AB) = 1 - [P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cup B)] = 1 - p - q + r \\, ; \\\\ \\text{又} &amp; P(A \\overline{B}) = P(B - A \\overline{B}) = P(B) - P(AB) = q - (p + q - r) = r - p \\, , \\text{所以} &amp; \\\\ &amp; &amp; P(A \\cup \\overline{B}) = P(A \\overline{B}) = 1 - P(\\overline{A B}) = 1 - [P(B) - P(AB)] \\\\ &amp; &amp; \\qquad= 1 - [P(B) - P(A) - P(B) + P(A \\cup B)] = 1 + p - r \\, . \\end{aligned}</div>"
