    {
      "id": "q0020",
      "number": 20,
      "header": "#20-Easy",
      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "prompt_html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\text{若 } P(A) = 0.5,\\, P(B) = 0.4,\\, P(A-B) = 0.3,\\,\\,\\text{求 } P(A \\cup B) = ( \\ )、\\ P( \\overline{A} \\cup \\overline{B}) = ( \\ ).\">\\text{若 } P(A) = 0.5,\\, P(B) = 0.4,\\, P(A-B) = 0.3,\\,\\,\\text{求 } P(A \\cup B) = ( \\ )、\\ P( \\overline{A} \\cup \\overline{B}) = ( \\ ).</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"0 . 7 ; \\quad 0 . 8\">0 . 7 ; \\quad 0 . 8</span>"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}0.4; \\quad 0.8\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}0.4; \\quad 0.8\\end{aligned}</span>"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}0.5;\\quad 0.9\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}0.5;\\quad 0.9\\end{aligned}</span>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"0.1; \\quad 1.0\">0.1; \\quad 1.0</span>"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\text{解法一}\\quad&amp; \\text{因为}P(A-B)=0.3&gt;P(A)-P(B)=0.1,\\text{又}P(A-B)&lt;P(A),\\text{这说明}A\\text{与}B\\text{既不相互斥，又无包含关系，而是一般的相容关系。因此加法公式，有}\\\\&amp; P(A\\cup B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(AB),\\\\&amp;\\text{又由}P(A-B)=P(A-AB)=P(A)-P(AB),\\text{故得}\\\\&amp; P(AB)=P(A)-P(A-B)=0.5-0.3=0.2,\\\\&amp; \\text{所以}P(A\\cup B)=0.5+0.4-0.2=0.7,\\text{而}\\\\&amp; \\overline{P(A\\cup B)}=\\overline{P(AB)}=1-\\overline{P(AB)}=1-0.2=0.8\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}\\text{解法一}\\quad&amp; \\text{因为}P(A-B)=0.3&gt;P(A)-P(B)=0.1,\\text{又}P(A-B)&lt;P(A),\\text{这说明}A\\text{与}B\\text{既不相互斥，又无包含关系，而是一般的相容关系。因此加法公式，有}\\\\&amp; P(A\\cup B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(AB),\\\\&amp;\\text{又由}P(A-B)=P(A-AB)=P(A)-P(AB),\\text{故得}\\\\&amp; P(AB)=P(A)-P(A-B)=0.5-0.3=0.2,\\\\&amp; \\text{所以}P(A\\cup B)=0.5+0.4-0.2=0.7,\\text{而}\\\\&amp; \\overline{P(A\\cup B)}=\\overline{P(AB)}=1-\\overline{P(AB)}=1-0.2=0.8\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\text{解法二}\\quad&amp; \\text{由于}A\\text{与}B\\text{相容，因此}A\\cup B\\text{可写为}B\\cup(A-B),B\\text{与}A-B\\text{互斥，从而}\\\\&amp; P(A\\cup B)=P(B\\cup(A-B))=P(B)+P(A-B)=0.4+0.3=0.7.\\\\&amp; A=A(B\\cup\\overline{B})=AB\\cup A\\overline{B},\\\\&amp; P(A)=P(AB)+P(A\\overline{B})=P(AB)+P(A-B),\\\\&amp; \\text{所以}P(AB)=P(A)-P(A-B)=0.5-0.3=0.2,\\text{于是}\\\\&amp; \\overline{P(A\\cup B)}=\\overline{P(AB)}=1-\\overline{P(AB)}=1-0.2=0.8\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}\\text{解法二}\\quad&amp; \\text{由于}A\\text{与}B\\text{相容，因此}A\\cup B\\text{可写为}B\\cup(A-B),B\\text{与}A-B\\text{互斥，从而}\\\\&amp; P(A\\cup B)=P(B\\cup(A-B))=P(B)+P(A-B)=0.4+0.3=0.7.\\\\&amp; A=A(B\\cup\\overline{B})=AB\\cup A\\overline{B},\\\\&amp; P(A)=P(AB)+P(A\\overline{B})=P(AB)+P(A-B),\\\\&amp; \\text{所以}P(AB)=P(A)-P(A-B)=0.5-0.3=0.2,\\text{于是}\\\\&amp; \\overline{P(A\\cup B)}=\\overline{P(AB)}=1-\\overline{P(AB)}=1-0.2=0.8\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "q0021",
      "number": 21,
      "header": "#21-Easy",
      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "prompt_html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\text{设事件}A,B \\text{仅发生一个的概率为}0.3，\\text{且}P(A)+P(B)=0.5\\text{．则}A,B \\text{至少有一个不发生的概率为}().\">\\text{设事件}A,B \\text{仅发生一个的概率为}0.3，\\text{且}P(A)+P(B)=0.5\\text{．则}A,B \\text{至少有一个不发生的概率为}().</span>",
